% soldiers
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from soldiers.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=soldiers
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move left with *a thing* is made; known as left_1.
    the move left with *a boy* and *a second boy* is made; known as left_2.
    the move right with *a thing* is made; known as right_1.
    the move right with *a boy* and *a second boy* is made; known as right_2.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* is a boat; known as boat.
    *a thing* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is current; known as current.
    *a thing* is the location of *a second thing*; known as location.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move left with *a thing* is legal; known as legal_left_1.
    the move left with *a boy* and *a second boy* is legal; known as legal_left_2.
    the move right with *a thing* is legal; known as legal_right_1.
    the move right with *a boy* and *a second boy* is legal; known as legal_right_2.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a soldier* is individual.
    *a soldier* is a soldier.
    *a boy* is boy.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base soldiers includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/soldiers.hrf".

a soldier is individual if
    the soldier is a soldier.

a soldier is individual if
    the soldier is boy.

s1 is a soldier.

s2 is a soldier.

s3 is a soldier.

b1 is boy.

b2 is boy.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the succ of 8 is 9.

the succ of 9 is 10.

the succ of 10 is 11.

the succ of 11 is 12.

the succ of 12 is 13.

the move left with a thing is legal at a time if
    right is a boat at the time
    and the thing is the location of right at the time.

the move right with a thing is legal at a time if
    left is a boat at the time
    and the thing is the location of left at the time.

the move left with b1 and b2 is legal at a time if
    right is a boat at the time
    and b1 is the location of right at the time
    and b2 is the location of right at the time.

the move right with b1 and b2 is legal at a time if
    left is a boat at the time
    and b1 is the location of left at the time
    and b2 is the location of left at the time.

the goal of robot is 100 at a time if
    s1 is the location of right at the time
    and s2 is the location of right at the time
    and s3 is the location of right at the time
    and b1 is the location of left at the time
    and b2 is the location of left at the time
    and left is a boat at the time.

the goal of robot is 0 at a time if
    s1 is the location of left at the time.

the goal of robot is 0 at a time if
    s2 is the location of left at the time.

the goal of robot is 0 at a time if
    s3 is the location of left at the time.

the goal of robot is 0 at a time if
    b1 is the location of right at the time.

the goal of robot is 0 at a time if
    b2 is the location of right at the time.

the goal of robot is 0 at a time if
    right is a boat at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    s1 is the location of right at the time
    and s2 is the location of right at the time
    and s3 is the location of right at the time
    and b1 is the location of left at the time
    and b2 is the location of left at the time
    and left is a boat at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    13 is current at the time.

when the move left with a thing is made
then left is a boat
    and the thing is the location of left
    and it is not the case that right is a boat
    and it is not the case that the thing is the location of right.

when the move left with a thing is made
    and a second thing is current
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
then the third thing is current
    and it is not the case that the second thing is current.

when the move left with a boy and a second boy is made
then left is a boat
    and the boy is the location of left
    and the second boy is the location of left
    and it is not the case that right is a boat
    and it is not the case that the boy is the location of right
    and it is not the case that the second boy is the location of right.

when the move left with a boy and a second boy is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

when the move right with a thing is made
then right is a boat
    and the thing is the location of right
    and it is not the case that left is a boat
    and it is not the case that the thing is the location of left.

when the move right with a thing is made
    and a second thing is current
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
then the third thing is current
    and it is not the case that the second thing is current.

when the move right with a boy and a second boy is made
then right is a boat
    and the boy is the location of right
    and the second boy is the location of right
    and it is not the case that left is a boat
    and it is not the case that the boy is the location of left
    and it is not the case that the second boy is the location of left.

when the move right with a boy and a second boy is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

it must not be true that
    the move left with a thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move left with the thing is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move left with a boy and a second boy is made
    and it is not the case that the move left with the boy and the second boy is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move right with a thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move right with the thing is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move right with a boy and a second boy is made
    and it is not the case that the move right with the boy and the second boy is legal.

initially s1 is the location of left
    and s2 is the location of left
    and s3 is the location of left
    and b1 is the location of left
    and b2 is the location of left
    and left is a boat
    and 1 is current
    and robot is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - boat(left)
%   - control(robot)
%   - current(13)
%   - location(b1,left)
%   - location(b2,left)
%   - location(s1,left)
%   - location(s2,left)
%   - location(s3,left)
scenario play is:
    the move right with b1 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move left with b1 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move right with b2 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move left with b2 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move right with s2 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move left with s2 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move right with b1 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move left with b1 is made from 8 to 9.
    the move right with b2 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move left with b2 is made from 10 to 11.
    the move right with s2 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move left with s2 is made from 12 to 13.

